From: Cursor Agent <cursor[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 13:42:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Ship DataLund Gantt 1.7.0.0 downloads and feature copy

Host pbiviz on the public site, point download buttons at /downloads/, and document Expand/Collapse plus optional time window.
---
 demo/index.html                       |   4 ++--
 index.html                            |  11 ++++++-----
 public/downloads/GanttSampleData.xlsx | Bin 0 -> 6207 bytes
 public/downloads/ganttChart.pbiviz    | Bin 0 -> 37230 bytes
 public/visuals/gantt/index.html       |  17 ++++++++++++-----
 5 files changed, 20 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 public/downloads/GanttSampleData.xlsx
 create mode 100644 public/downloads/ganttChart.pbiviz

diff --git a/demo/index.html b/demo/index.html
index c89583e..be12f38 100644
--- a/demo/index.html
+++ b/demo/index.html
@@ -84,13 +84,13 @@
             <div class="cta-row demo-actions">
               <a
                 class="btn btn-primary"
-                href="https://github.com/Datalundno/GANTT/raw/main/ganttChart/downloads/ganttChart.pbiviz"
+                href="/downloads/ganttChart.pbiviz"
                 download
                 data-analytics-download="ganttChart.pbiviz"
               >Download .pbiviz</a>
               <a
                 class="btn btn-ghost"
-                href="https://github.com/Datalundno/GANTT/raw/main/ganttChart/downloads/GanttSampleData.xlsx"
+                href="/downloads/GanttSampleData.xlsx"
                 download
                 data-analytics-download="GanttSampleData.xlsx"
               >Sample Excel</a>
diff --git a/index.html b/index.html
index 42cc7f6..b3d7519 100644
--- a/index.html
+++ b/index.html
@@ -119,7 +119,8 @@
             },
             "description": "Free Power BI Gantt chart visual for tasks, progress, groups, and deadlines on one timeline.",
             "url": "https://datalund.no/visuals/gantt/",
-            "downloadUrl": "https://github.com/Datalundno/GANTT/raw/main/ganttChart/downloads/ganttChart.pbiviz",
+            "downloadUrl": "https://datalund.no/downloads/ganttChart.pbiviz",
+            "softwareVersion": "1.7.0.0",
             "publisher": { "@id": "https://datalund.no/#organization" },
             "isAccessibleForFree": true
           }
@@ -237,9 +238,9 @@
                 Works in Power BI Desktop as a <code>.pbiviz</code> file.
               </p>
               <ul class="feature-list">
+                <li>Expand / Collapse groups from the toolbar</li>
+                <li>Optional time window (Format → General)</li>
                 <li>Click a bar to filter the rest of the report</li>
-                <li>Multi-select with Ctrl / Cmd</li>
-                <li>Hover for dates, duration, and progress</li>
               </ul>
               <div class="cta-row feature-cta">
                 <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/demo/">Open demo</a>
@@ -292,13 +293,13 @@
             <div class="cta-row">
               <a
                 class="btn btn-primary"
-                href="https://github.com/Datalundno/GANTT/raw/main/ganttChart/downloads/ganttChart.pbiviz"
+                href="/downloads/ganttChart.pbiviz"
                 download
                 data-analytics-download="ganttChart.pbiviz"
               >Download .pbiviz</a>
               <a
                 class="btn btn-ghost"
-                href="https://github.com/Datalundno/GANTT/raw/main/ganttChart/downloads/GanttSampleData.xlsx"
+                href="/downloads/GanttSampleData.xlsx"
                 download
                 data-analytics-download="GanttSampleData.xlsx"
               >Sample Excel</a>
